{"seq":6,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T22:25:43.941Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f2240061571052f1ed310076df2289f61068d1044ca06c0b45240c34da76ac87","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Gideon Sato: you first reported it at 10:42 AM on 3 Aug (workspace time, UTC-5), in this channel. You said both inbound lanes showed a white screen after badge scan.\n\nThe guard was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard. That's from your 10:42 post, and nothing later in the channel contradicts it. Mateo posted at 10:44 that six trucks were waiting at the east gate.\n\nKiosk 1 came back at 11:03, when Mateo said the guard checked in trailer 8836 and dispatch could see it. You posted at 11:08 that both lanes had been working since 11:07. That makes about 21 to 25 minutes on the clipboard, depending on whether you count to kiosk 1 or to both lanes.\n\nThe channel doesn't say what the guard did between 10:42 and 11:03 beyond the clipboard, or when kiosk 2 recovered.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":7,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T22:25:47.441Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f997638f12d6f23d3fedf5eee860ddeec27cdb52c39ab5edee8089e8ad0aa435","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"I replied to Gideon in the thread in #inc-vtg-hartford.\n\n- **First report:** 10:42 AM on 3 Aug, in that channel. He said both inbound lanes showed a white screen after badge scan.\n- **The guard:** he was writing trailer numbers on a clipboard. Gideon's 10:42 post says so, and nothing later in the channel contradicts it.\n- **Recovery:** Mateo said kiosk 1 was back at 11:03, when the guard checked in trailer 8836. Gideon posted at 11:08 that both lanes had been working since 11:07. That makes roughly 21 to 25 minutes on the clipboard, depending on which of those you count to.\n\nI also told him the channel doesn't say what the guard did between 10:42 and 11:03 beyond the clipboard, or when kiosk 2 recovered. I added a note that the times are in workspace time (UTC-5), which I assumed from the clock offset."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
